            <field>
              <name>TIMERMAX</name>
              <description>Trigger counter count max, used as initial condition to trigger. Also used repeatedly each time counter reaches it to restart trigger timer at zero. To update this value, first disable the INTTRIGTIMER by setting TIMEREN to DIS, change TIMERMAX, and then reenable it INTTRIGTIMER by setting TIMEREN to EN again.</description>
