        <register>
          <name>CHACHABLOCKCNTLSB</name>
          <description>The two first words (n) in the last row of the cipher matrix are the block counter. At the end of each block (512b), the block_cnt for the next block is written by HW to the block_cnt_lsb and block_cnt_msb registers. Need reset block counter , if start new message.</description>
          <addressOffset>0x000003B8</addressOffset>
